# Library module

> Read this file first when you resume work on this module, and keep it current (root `CLAUDE.md`,
> "Developing a module"). The project rules are in the root `CLAUDE.md`; the steps in
> `docs/creating-a-module.md`; run `/check-module Library` before calling the module done.

**Purpose:** TODO: what the module manages, for whom, and what it adds to the back office, the
public site and the API.

## Resources and permissions

Permissions are `library-<resource>.<operation>`, generated from `Config/Module.php` (never
written by hand).

- `library-main` (page: `view`): the module's screen `<back office>/library` (`backend_path('library')`).
- Default grants: admin `library-main.*` and the tables' grants below.
- Settings: `Library.perPage`. Widget `library.main` (`Widgets/LibraryWidget.php`). Scheduled
  task `Tasks/LibraryTask.php`.
- Tables: `library_shelves`, `library_books` (+ `library_books_translations`) (one migration per table, `down()` implemented).
- `library-shelves` (crud: list, show, export): table `library_shelves`, `<back office>/library/shelves`. Generated by the code generator (definition in the Devtools wizard / `make:module --definition`).
- `library-books` (crud: list, show, add, edit, delete, export, import, trash, restore, purge, lend, writeoff, prices, all): table `library_books` (+ `library_books_translations`), `<back office>/library/books`, API `api/v1/library/books`. Generated by the code generator (definition in the Devtools wizard / `make:module --definition`).

## Main pieces

- `Config/Module.php` (manifest), `Config/Routes.php` (every back-office route has its `can:`
  filter; the API routes have the `kpapy` filter).
- `Controllers/Home.php` + `Views/index.php` (example screen with the ES-module component
  `Assets/js/library.js`, `data-component="library/library"`).
- `Database/Seeds/LibrarySeeder.php` (initial data), `LibraryDemoSeeder.php` (demo data:
  `php spark modules:demo Library`).
- Texts: `Language/{ca,es,en}/Library.php` (same keys).

